# Devto WP Importer Architecture

- Keep bootstrap minimal in `devto-wp-importer.php`: define constants, load Composer autoload, expose `welabs_devto_wp_importer()`, and initialize the singleton.
- Keep core plugin logic inside `includes/DevtoWpImporter.php` under namespace `WeLabs\DevtoWpImporter\`.
- Register behavior through hooks and filters (`add_action`, `add_filter`) instead of direct execution paths.
- Prefer container-style class access via the plugin singleton for feature modules (for example assets, REST, import services).
- When adding WooCommerce or REST integrations, use dedicated methods and hooks (`rest_api_init`, WooCommerce-specific actions) rather than scattered callbacks.
- Put new service classes in `includes/` and wire them from `init_classes()` to keep a single composition point.

## Integration Notes

- Keep plugin text domain as `devto-wp-importer`.
- Use action/filter prefixes based on plugin slug, e.g. `devto_wp_importer_*`.
- Do not edit core WordPress/WooCommerce/Dokan files; extend behavior through hooks only.
